      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The criticism that powerful nations or corporations influence these organizations is indeed valid and a critical point of debate. Concerns often arise that the rules, while ostensibly global, may reflect the economic interests of the wealthiest members rather than the needs of developing nations. However, it is also true that without some level of global standardization, the very chaos and exploitation you mention could become widespread, harming everyone in the long run. Ultimately, the impact depends heavily on the transparency and accountability within each specific organization.",
